<title>EGYPT: Egyptian firm postpones wheat bran tender.</title>
<headline>Egyptian firm postpones wheat bran tender.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian state company Misr Oil and Soap said on Wednesday it was postponing until further notice the process of opening bids for 30,000 tonnes of wheat bran pellets. The previous deadline for bids was Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
